    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold\">Your tributary followed Vrathur, who was known to be wary and selective with how aelkhazak should lavish their homes and crafts. You are Trained in Crafting, and gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.QLeMH5mQgh28sa5o]{Specialty Crafting} feat. When you benefit from Specialty Crafting, you increase the circumstance bonus it gives by 1, but you take a -1 circumstance penalty to Craft checks for things outside your Specialty. If you choose alchemical items for @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.QLeMH5mQgh28sa5o]{Specialty Crafting}, you also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.is3Oz9wt11lNq62K]{Alchemical Crafting} feat. Otherwise, you gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.voYr7ygVcWmlg1f4]{Crafter's Appraisal} feat.</span></p>",
